{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pulls/258","id":4910553937,"node_id":"PR_kwDORoMukM8AAAABJLEbUQ","html_url":"https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pull/258","diff_url":"https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pull/258.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pull/258.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/issues/258","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pulls/258/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pulls/258/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/issues/258/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/statuses/287101f4bb419bd5a76cfe8702c80b6e6df69c9c","number":258,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"docs(marketplace): add task documentation layers and plans","user":{"login":"ranzuozhou","id":35538471,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTM4NDcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35538471?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou","html_url":"https://github.com/ranzuozhou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ranzuozhou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## 问题与结果\n工程任务的计划、评估和验证材料平铺且逐轮重复，读者难以区分正式约定、接受范围、实施事实和当前交接。本PR建立canonical/working两层、稳定任务入口及主PLAN/REPORT复用机制；Issue保持工程进度正本。管理者、产品和开发运维可从同一入口找到对应来源与责任。\n\n## 实现\n- 文档框架/执行规范v3.0及新ADR；layer独立于type/state/批准/完成，新增PLAN和REPORT。草稿SPEC仍canonical，完成REPORT仍working；公共working按用途/owner维护。\n- 薄INDEX＋一个主PLAN＋实际结果出现后的一个主REPORT，复用到会话、子PR、失败恢复和后续批次；任务完成不搬迁。九模板和相关仓库执行技能适配。\n- 固定Git原件与受控快照、真实接受基线、严格新文档/显式旧文档兼容、导航元绑定、历史封存完整声明资源与实际隔离复制；不凭路径/类型推断层次，不把hash替代原件。\n- 单Epic #257、唯一活动主PR #258→受保护develop；内部#259/#260/#261已正常合入集成分支，必要Harness/A6/独立审查及实际候选检查通过，无bypass。CI支持内部codex目标，base checker、required名称、权限及原去重/取消约束保留。\n- HTML原Epic #217的PR1有界试行：原合同/证据保持，71具名来源及43原运行资源逐项核对；三fresh模拟角色的原提问/完整输出/实际读本可恢复，限定阅读交接通过。当前#239、历史批准缺证及未覆盖产品验收保持。\n\n## 入口与证据\n[实施入口](https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/blob/codex/task-documentation/plans/257-task-documentation/INDEX.md) · [主REPORT](https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/blob/codex/task-documentation/plans/257-task-documentation/%5BREPORT%5D_Task_Documentation.md) · [HTML试行入口](https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/blob/codex/task-documentation/plans/217-html-guide-kit/INDEX.md)\n\n固定实现/试行候选已完整本机528/528、0skip；试行最终16c29dc双平台CI、两平台各13真实安装及6Diagram+18LEK缓存Python通过。Linux527pass/1skip仅Windows大小写专属，已在Windows528/528执行；不隐去平台跳过。43旧资源分3PNG raw/40文本确定性CRLF表示，原hash不改；110既有封存索引逐项声明资源检查通过。失败、修复、原生/客户端/效果未覆盖和未知历史聚合摘要分别保留。\n\n本主PR最终head `287101f4bb419bd5a76cfe8702c80b6e6df69c9c` 的A6/Validate和[双平台实际CI](https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace/actions/runs/39149817241)全部成功：Windows528/528、0skip；Linux527pass/1skip（仅Windows专属且已在Windows执行）；两平台各13实际安装、6Diagram+18LEK缓存Python通过。目标develop当前仍要求1个真实非作者批准，实际reviews=[]、REVIEW_REQUIRED，无未解决线程；未合入、未bypass。Owner成品最终接受仍独立待提供，Agent审查/合成阅读不代替两者。\n\n## 自检与边界\n- [x] 原意、真实接受B1、实施和验证分别可追溯；新确认/恢复复用主文档。\n- [x] 相关规范、模板、技能、Harness、索引与A6相容。\n- [x] 实际来源/声明资源及独立阅读分别检查；原失败/缺证可恢复。\n- [x] 插件/版本/登记/README badge/品牌/旧冻结计划与原RUNBOOK证据保持原内容。\n- [x] 本机、子PR及本主PR最新head工程检查通过；真实保护批准/Owner接受仍待，不提前关闭Epic。\n- [x] 无发布、规则放宽、保护绕过、历史批量迁移或旧插件验收恢复。\n\n新任务按持续维护需要采用；旧任务选择性接入，后续迁移范围由Owner决定。新增只读原件/验证快照有明确开销，不声称性能或真实人群效果提升。恢复通过新提交撤回本次变更，保留接受历史和证据。\nRefs: #257\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-18T15:56:00Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T17:48:46Z","closed_at":"2026-10-18T17:48:46Z","merged_at":"2026-10-18T17:48:46Z","merge_commit_sha":"1212514f2cd3588fbcef4f407e6f5e7269e4093e","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"MJ-AgentLab:codex/task-documentation","ref":"codex/task-documentation","repo":{"id":1183002256,"node_id":"R_kgDORoMukA","name":"mj-agentlab-marketplace","full_name":"MJ-AgentLab/mj-agentlab-marketplace","owner":{"login":"MJ-AgentLab","id":262496159,"node_id":"O_kgDOD6Vfnw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262496159?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJ-AgentLab","html_url":"https://github.com/MJ-AgentLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJ-AgentLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJ-AgentLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJ-AgentLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJ-AgentLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJ-AgentLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJ-AgentLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJ-AgentLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJ-AgentLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJ-AgentLab/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"Claude Code Plugin Marketplace for MJ-AgentLab","homepage":"","language":"JavaScript","visibility":"public","is_template":false,"top